  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Unity has no tool for sculpting a free mesh: ProBuilder edits flat faces. Soft shapes come in three ways: the Terrain, shaped with brushes inside Unity; models made in another program (a Blender sculpt, a scan, an AI-generated model), imported as FBX; and generators that build rocks or trees from settings.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Of the three objects, which one can be reshaped with a brush inside Unity?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select each of the three objects.\n2. Compare their components: a Terrain, or a Mesh Filter and a Mesh Renderer.\n3. Select the terrain \u203A Paint Terrain \u203A Raise or Lower Terrain, and paint on it.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: 1 \xB7 Meshes \u203A Asset-Management \xB7 15 \xB7 Terrain \u203A Terrain-Manual</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
