  m_text: "<b>Soft surfaces</b>\n<size=70%>Ground, rocks, plants and bodies: surfaces that curve everywhere. How Unity makes them, and where they come from.\n\n<b>Row 1 \xB7 Soft surfaces:</b> 1 Hard and soft \xB7 2 Where soft shapes come from \xB7 3 A terrain is an image \xB7 4 Plants are cards\n\nEvery station has its own camera. Select it and look through it in the Game view.</size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
